Note on test fixtures

tests/fixtures/ contains small trimmed excerpts of third-party web pages,
retained solely to test HTML parsers offline and deterministically. Each file
records the URL it came from and the date it was captured. That content belongs
to its respective publishers and is not covered by the license above.

Note on use

This software automates a web browser. Scraping search engine results pages is
against the terms of service of major search engines, and individual sites have
their own terms and robots directives. `config/domains.yaml` exposes
`respect_robots` per domain precisely so that choice is explicit and yours to
make. You are responsible for how you operate it.
